{
    "title": "Sporcle Party: Social Trivia",
    "description": "From Sporcle, the world's largest trivia company, comes Sporcle Party. Challenge friends to topics from movies, geography, sports, literature, history and so much more. OR make your own pack. Perfect for office parties, classroom fun, baby showers and playing with friends - in person or virtually.\r\n\r\nGet the Party going with your friends in this FREE trivia game from the greatest trivia company on the planet.\r\n\r\nKEY FEATURES\r\n\u2022 Free, fun and addictive trivia game experience\r\n\u2022 Play with your friends and family\r\n\u2022 Compete against people from around the world\r\n\u2022 Wager points from 1-10 based on how confident you are in your answer\r\n\u2022 Create your own packs and share them with anyone\r\n\u2022 Thousands of questions and answers across all sorts of topics\r\n\r\nYou can find hours of trivia entertainment right on your phone, so grab some friends and get started!\r\n\r\nJOIN THE PARTY:\r\n\u2022 Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/sporcleparty @sporcleparty\r\n\u2022 Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/sporcle\r\n\u2022 Twitter: https://twitter.com/sporcle @sporcletv\r\n\u2022 YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/c/sporcle\r\n\u2022 Twitch: https://www.twitch.tv/sporcle\r\n\u2022 And on Sporcle: https://www.sporcle.com/groups/party-chat",
